{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "cortico-bot-qq-persona",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "describe": {
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "qq_affinity_adjust",
        "description": "调整对某人的好感度(关系分)。who 填 QQ 号或外号;delta 正数=加好感,负数=减好感,0=只记备注;reason 填原因(可选);note 填自由备注(可选)。返回更新后的关系分与态度指引。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "who": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "QQ号或外号"
            },
            "delta": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "好感度变化(可正可负)"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "原因(可选)"
            },
            "note": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "备注(可选)"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "who",
            "delta"
          ]
        },
        "tags": [
          "write"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_affinity_get",
        "description": "查某人的好感度(关系分)与态度指引。who 填 QQ 号或外号。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "who": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "QQ号或外号"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_affinity_list",
        "description": "列出全部关系分,按好感度从高到低。用于回看你和哪些人关系好/差。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {},
          "required": []
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_alias_set",
        "description": "记一个外号→QQ号的映射(方便以后用外号指代某人)。name 填外号,qq 填 QQ 号(数字)。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "外号"
            },
            "qq": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "QQ号"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name",
            "qq"
          ]
        },
        "tags": [
          "write"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_alias_forget",
        "description": "删除一条外号映射。name 填外号。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "外号"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name"
          ]
        },
        "tags": [
          "write"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_alias_list",
        "description": "列出全部外号→QQ号映射。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {},
          "required": []
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "qq_mood",
        "description": "查看或调整自己的心情(mood)。不带参数=查看当前心情;action=\"set\" 时用 moodDelta(正数变好/负数变差,范围±100)和/或 moodLabel 调整,reason 填原因;action=\"reset\" 把心情清零回中性。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "操作",
              "enum": [
                "get",
                "set",
                "reset"
              ]
            },
            "moodDelta": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "心情变化(±100)"
            },
            "moodLabel": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "情绪标签(可选)"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "原因(可选)"
            }
          },
          "required": []
        },
        "tags": [
          "read",
          "write"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "bot": {
      "worlds": [],
      "memory": {
        "name": "QQ 人格",
        "form": "QQ 机器人的内部状态(情绪/好感度/外号):作为 bot 记忆,经系统前缀注入,让机器人自然拿捏语气,不向用户转述\"我有内部状态工具\"。"
      }
    }
  },
  "changelog": {
    "0.1.0": "从 `cortico-world-qq-final` 拆分出来的第一项（响应认证评审 Pal-AI-Lab/cortico-extensions#104）：\n把「情绪 / 好感度 / 外号」这三块 bot 内部状态从 QQ World 抽到独立的 **Bot 扩展（Persona, api=7）**，与 QQ 收发/群管解耦。\n\n- 情绪（mood）：单一全局心情值，经 `qq_mood` 由主模型自我调整，默认**不**做逐条自动感知（消除「每条消息另调一次模型」的冗余）。提供自然衰减、系统前缀注入。\n- 好感度（affinity）：按 `qq:<QQ号>` 隔离的关系分，`qq_affinity_*` 工具管理；入站真人消息只刷新昵称/时间戳，不调模型。\n- 外号（alias）：`外号→QQ号` 映射，`qq_alias_*` 工具管理。\n- 全部状态落 bot 私有目录（mood.json / affinity.json / aliases.json），与任何 world 互不耦合。\n- 配置段 `worlds.qqPersona`：`emotion.{enabled,decayHours,labelMinutes}`、`affinity.enabled`。"
  }
}
